                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The 17 MILLION Americans you\u2019re kicking off their health insurance aren\u2019t \u201cminutiae.\u201d\n\nRepublicans are about to force the largest loss of health care in American history \u2014 and they clearly couldn\u2019t care less about working families.",
