                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 23,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The people Trump and Republicans are attacking with their Big, Ugly Bill are our friends and neighbors.\n\nIf they pass this bill, families across Pennsylvania will suffer:\n\n\u274c 483,868 people across Pennsylvania will lose health insurance\n\u274c Hospitals across our state will be at risk of closing their doors\n\u274c At least 143,000 people across Pennsylvania could lose some or all food assistance\n\u274c 37,000 manufacturing and energy jobs in Pennsylvania would be eliminated\n\u274c $360 average yearly increase in energy bills for Pennsylvania families\n\u274c 123,665 students in Pennsylvania could have their Pell grants cut or eliminated entirely\n\nIt's truly evil to punish this many people to give tax breaks to billionaires \u2014 and I won't stop fighting back.",
                "text_lang": "en",
