                "text": "Trump said he would \"love and cherish\" Medicaid.\n\nWe all know what happens when Donald Trump promises to love and cherish anyone or anything.\n\nRepublicans are trying to kick millions of Americans off their health care and make the largest cut to Medicaid in history today.",
