                "retweet_count": 19,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicare and Medicaid are a sacred promise, keeping millions of families healthy.\n\nHere in Philly, 44% of our neighbors count on Medicaid.\n\nI grew up in a working family, and I know how important that security is. I will always fight to defend your health care.",
